{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Bily'sine ?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bily'Sine is an <strong>adventure game</strong> (2D, top view, pixel art) where you <strong>play as a human lost</strong> in a <strong>mysterious world</strong> populated by magicians forced to capture you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore</strong> the world of Bily'Sine, <strong>unlock its secrets</strong> and battle in <strong>magical duels</strong> to <strong>find your way back to the world</strong> of Humans!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapter 1 is included in the demo!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the first moments of the adventure, lasting between 45 minutes and 1 hour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and master a short but intense bullet-hell combat mode where you can kill or neutralise your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/786dca0df8655f67ed4c039b001f1785.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=259 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know Lapon, who will accompany you through a first underground level (the tomb of memories) and then a magical level (the world of illusions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/b4737e32a174a39ca2b7518563acd0b3.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=274 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a revisited retro save system where secrets allow you to replay different moments in the scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/d2bfec57666dac854be649136eb1bc41.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, as the chosen one, you'll face several mini-bosses before coming face to face with the game's antagonist: Queen Altera!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/e92a3f088f610ff1601c30d56cc2b261.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo ends when you triumph and leave the tomb of memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/7545afb4400014ea41f3f48f4ceb28ed.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=262 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069900?t=1760356731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069900?t=1760356731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/b6987ac07f5c640fc7086a69a23ac4caf39cc8c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760356731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/b6987ac07f5c640fc7086a69a23ac4caf39cc8c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760356731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Bily'sine ?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bily'Sine is an <strong>adventure game</strong> (2D, top view, pixel art) where you <strong>play as a human lost</strong> in a <strong>mysterious world</strong> populated by magicians forced to capture you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore</strong> the world of Bily'Sine, <strong>unlock its secrets</strong> and battle in <strong>magical duels</strong> to <strong>find your way back to the world</strong> of Humans!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapter 1 is included in the demo!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the first moments of the adventure, lasting between 45 minutes and 1 hour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and master a short but intense bullet-hell combat mode where you can kill or neutralise your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/786dca0df8655f67ed4c039b001f1785.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=259 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know Lapon, who will accompany you through a first underground level (the tomb of memories) and then a magical level (the world of illusions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/b4737e32a174a39ca2b7518563acd0b3.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=274 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a revisited retro save system where secrets allow you to replay different moments in the scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/d2bfec57666dac854be649136eb1bc41.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, as the chosen one, you'll face several mini-bosses before coming face to face with the game's antagonist: Queen Altera!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/e92a3f088f610ff1601c30d56cc2b261.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo ends when you triumph and leave the tomb of memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/extras/7545afb4400014ea41f3f48f4ceb28ed.avif?t=1760356731\" width=1560 height=262 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Kazuma"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3964680","name":"Bily'Sine"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069900/78b795ed42ccdc98c1822d9487d66f31301eafab/header.jpg?t=1760356731","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12 (Sierra) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU compatible OpenGL 2.0 or Metal<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Core Audio compatible (built-in Mac is sufficient)</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / M1 ou M2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal 1.2 compatible GPU or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Core Audio (built-in) or compatible external audio interface</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069900/1798698741/89fb040acc80220326fa92d6bbaa726c629b78e6/1759130445/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760133843","dash_h264":"htt